---
title: "15 · Presets as building blocks"
lesson: "@include embeds another preset where it stands, and the indented key = value lines under it turn that preset's dials: its $bindings. The preset stays as it is; you choose the medium and the vantage, the rest still rolls. The effects/ presets are made for this: @include effects/living_clay inside an H3 reel chunk turns it into an operator on your own scene."
tags: [tutorial]
---
# Everything the landscape preset rolls, with two of its dials turned.
@include krea/07_landscape
  medium = a Japanese woodblock print with flat colour, fine carved outlines and a sky graded from indigo to white
  vantage = seen from a high ridge
